  "text": {
    "intro": "A jobbing print shop where every job has its quoted price, and one hell-box filling up faster than anybody will admit to.\nFive compositors are involved. Determine each compositor's quoted price, typeface and mishap.\n- **Compositor**: Harriet Lisle, Cecil Braddock, Ned Ashby, Winifred Oakes and Josiah Peake.\n- **Quoted price** (listed from cheaper to dearer): $3, $5, $7, $9 and $11.\n- **Typeface**: Perpetua, Bodoni, Plantin, Baskerville and Caslon.\n- **Mishap**: a slurred impression, an inverted sort, a clean run, a cracked chase and a loose quoin.\nEvery compositor has a different quoted price, typeface and mishap, so within each category every item is used exactly once.",
    "clues": [
      "The compositor who sets in Perpetua owns up to a cracked chase.",
      "At least one of the following holds, and possibly more than one: (a) Ned Ashby quotes $3. (b) Josiah Peake does not quote $9.",
      "The compositor who sets in Baskerville and $9 are exactly one price step apart in quoted price order, in one direction or the other.",
      "$9 falls somewhere between the compositor who owns up to a clean run and the compositor who owns up to an inverted sort in quoted price order, matching neither.",
      "$7 falls somewhere between the compositor who owns up to a loose quoin and the compositor who owns up to a slurred impression in quoted price order, matching neither.",
      "Winifred Oakes and $7 are exactly one price step apart in quoted price order, in one direction or the other.",
      "The compositor who sets in Plantin is dearer than $5 in quoted price order.",
      "The compositor who owns up to a loose quoin is dearer than $5 in quoted price order.",
      "The following two do NOT both hold; either one alone may hold, and so may neither: (a) Josiah Peake is cheaper than the compositor who sets in Baskerville in quoted price order. (b) Harriet Lisle does not set in Baskerville.",
      "Ned Ashby does not own up to a slurred impression.",
      "The compositor who owns up to a clean run falls somewhere between Cecil Braddock and the compositor who sets in Perpetua in quoted price order, matching neither.",
      "Cecil Braddock and the compositor who sets in Bodoni are exactly one price step apart in quoted price order, in one direction or the other.",
      "Josiah Peake and the compositor who owns up to an inverted sort are exactly one price step apart in quoted price order, in one direction or the other."
    ]
  }
